Source Files: fairSimulator.c modifiedFairSimulator.c
Compile and Run Instructions:
                              For fairSimulator.c
                              1. Open gnome-terminal
                              2. Go to the directory containing the source files
                              3. type: "gcc -Wall -o fairSimulator fairSimulator.c"  to check for any errors
                              4. type: "./fairSimulator" to run the program fairSimulator

                              For modifiedFairSimulator.c
                              1. Open gnome-terminal
                              2. Go to the directory containing the source files
                              3. type: "gcc -Wall -o modifiedFairSimulator modifiedFairSimulator.c"  to check for any errors
                              4. type: "./modifiedFairSimulator" to run the program modifiedFairSimulator
